WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.504
- I can see what's coming.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.470
- Let me state as plainly as I can.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.474
The greatest threat
the United States faces...

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:19.102
...is posed by the Soviet Union.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:26.777
History has asked much
of the Americans of our time.

00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:29.738
Much we have already given.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:33.075
Much more we must be prepared to give.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:38.872
We must maintain peace through
strength as long as necessary.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.380
- Recommend go to DEFCON 3.

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:51.176
- Once we do this thing...

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.473
...there's no going back.

